      <div class="article__main">
        <div class="article__body prose">
          <blockquote>
<ul>
<li><strong>Quick answer:</strong> The Vintage Vice City Pack is a <strong>free bonus</strong> with <strong>every GTA 6 purchase or pre-order made before 20 November 2026</strong>, Standard or Ultimate.</li>
<li><strong>Inside (per Polygon and The Verge):</strong> a '55 Vapid Stanier car, a garage near Ocean Beach, outfits and hairstyles, and a tropical weapon pattern.</li>
<li><strong>Deadline trap:</strong> some PlayStation Store text says “by November 19”. <strong>Buy by 19 Nov to be safe.</strong></li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Words used on this page.</strong> <em>Bonus</em> is an extra you get for free. <em>GTA+</em> is Rockstar’s monthly club. The free month is a different bonus.</p>
<h2 id="what-is-in-the-pack" tabindex="-1">What is in the pack</h2>
<div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Table"><table class="table">
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Item</th>
<th>Detail</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>'55 Vapid Stanier</td>
<td>A car</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Garage near Ocean Beach</td>
<td>Has a weapon locker and a place to drop off stolen goods</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Outfits and hairstyles</td>
<td>Per Polygon: a linen suit for Jason and a red sequin dress for Lucia, plus hairstyles</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Weapon pattern</td>
<td>A tropical pattern for weapons</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
<p>Rockstar describes the pack as items “that flash back to when the neon burned brightest”. How to open each item in the game is <strong>not announced</strong>. We will add the steps after launch.</p>
<p>![Vintage Vice City Pack contents card](TODO: image:vintage-vice-city-pack-step-1 — diagram, Designer’s original art: four icons for car, garage, outfits, weapon pattern; no Rockstar art without credit)
<em>Caption: Diagram. The four things in the Vintage Vice City Pack.</em></p>
<h2 id="who-gets-it" tabindex="-1">Who gets it</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Digital Standard and Ultimate</strong> bought or pre-ordered before 20 Nov 2026: yes.</li>
<li><strong>Boxed (code-in-box) Standard:</strong> yes, per Rockstar’s store listing as reported by Technobezz.</li>
<li><strong>Ultimate Edition Upgrade bought alone:</strong> the pack is part of the <strong>game</strong> offer, not the upgrade. The PlayStation page lists the upgrade as not eligible for the GTA+ offer. Check the store text before you buy.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="how-to-buy-before-the-deadline" tabindex="-1">How to buy before the deadline</h2>
<p><strong>PS5</strong></p>
<ol>
<li>Open <strong>PlayStation Store</strong>.</li>
<li>Search <strong>Grand Theft Auto VI</strong>.</li>
<li>Choose <strong>Standard</strong> or <strong>Ultimate</strong>.</li>
<li>Select the <strong>pre-order</strong> or <strong>buy</strong> button.</li>
<li>Check for a confirmation email. It has GTA+ steps.</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>Xbox Series X|S</strong></p>
<ol>
<li>Open the <strong>Microsoft Store</strong>.</li>
<li>Search <strong>Grand Theft Auto VI</strong>.</li>
<li>Choose <strong>Standard</strong> or <strong>Ultimate</strong>.</li>
<li>Select <strong>Pre-order</strong> or <strong>Buy</strong>.</li>
</ol>
<p>![PS5 store page showing the Vintage Vice City Pack in the edition list](TODO: image:vintage-vice-city-pack-step-2 — step screenshot, PS5: GTA VI page “Editions” listing with Vintage Vice City Pack)
<em>Caption: Step screenshot. The PS5 Store page lists the pack with the game.</em></p>
<h2 id="the-free-gta-month-separate-bonus" tabindex="-1">The free GTA+ month (separate bonus)</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Who:</strong> digital buyers before 20 Nov 2026. Boxed copies do not get it.</li>
<li><strong>PS5:</strong> after buying, open the <strong>GTA+</strong> page on PlayStation Store and follow the steps. <strong>Claim by 31 March 2027.</strong> One claim per account.</li>
<li><strong>Xbox:</strong> open the Store, select your <strong>profile icon</strong> at the top left, select <strong>Offers &amp; credits</strong>.</li>
<li><strong>Cost:</strong> free for one month, then it renews at the normal price until you cancel.</li>
</ul>
<p>![Xbox Offers and credits menu](TODO: image:vintage-vice-city-pack-step-3 — menu screen, Xbox: Store profile icon &gt; Offers &amp; credits)
<em>Caption: Menu screen. Where to find the GTA+ offer on Xbox.</em></p>
<h2 id="faq" tabindex="-1">FAQ</h2>
<h3 id="what-is-the-deadline-for-the-vintage-vice-city-pack" tabindex="-1">What is the deadline for the Vintage Vice City Pack?</h3>
<p>Buy or pre-order before 20 November 2026. Some PlayStation Store text says 19 November, so buy by then to be safe.</p>
<h3 id="is-the-pack-free" tabindex="-1">Is the pack free?</h3>
<p>Yes. It comes with the game purchase.</p>
<h3 id="does-the-standard-edition-get-it" tabindex="-1">Does the Standard Edition get it?</h3>
<p>Yes. Both editions do.</p>
<h3 id="does-the-boxed-version-get-it" tabindex="-1">Does the boxed version get it?</h3>
<p>Yes, per Rockstar’s listing as reported by Technobezz. The free GTA+ month is digital only.</p>
